+means that their exact character-sum and difference multiplicities obey the
+formal-duality identities.  If an invertible linear map has matrix A, its
+adjoint for the displayed pairing is A^T.  Transporting S0 by A therefore
+transports its formal dual T0 by the matrix B=(A^T)^(-1).
