+        "24,600 exact field operations at the shipping n=90 preset, whereas "
+        "noticing the outer-product structure reduces the unaided route to "
+        "272 exact field operations; the reference algorithm succeeds by design."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 190,
+}
