codex
The local gates pass, but I found a practical issue in the self-test itself: each random miss was being fully range-checked and partially matrix-multiplied before rejection, making the mandated 200,000-sample gate take three minutes. I’m adding an exact necessary rank-one check near the front of `verify`; it accepts exactly the same witnesses and preserves the oracle results, while rejecting almost every random candidate after two coordinates.
apply patch
